; The quadruped's animations, one for each kind. Times are seconds, angles degrees.

[[Always [[[Lay [Overlay [[Cycle Swish] [Rate 0.3] [Clock Idle]]]]]]]

 ; standing square on all fours, breathing
 [Animation Idle [[[To [Still Stance]] [Layers [[[Lay [Overlay [[Cycle Breath] [Rate 0.45] [Clock Idle]]]]]]]]]]

 ; as idle
 [Animation Relax [[[To Idle]]]]

 ; walking on all fours
 [Animation Walk [[[From [Some Idle]] [To [Cycled Stride [PerStep 0.5]]] [Over 0.2]]]]

 ; walking on all fours, backward
 [Animation WalkBack [[[From [Some Idle]] [To [Cycled Stride [PerStep -0.5]]] [Over 0.2]]]]

 ; rocked back hard, shuddering, then recovering slowly
 [Animation Hurt
  [[[From [Some Idle]]
    [To [Still Struck]]
    [Over 0.096]
    [Ease Linear]
    [Layers
     [[[Lay [Waver [[On [OnRoot [1 0 0]]] [Sway [[Amplitude 0.03]]] [Rate 9.549297] [Fade True]]]] [Over [Some 0.28]]]]]]
   [[To Idle] [Over 0.704] [Ease Out] [Marks [[End 1]]]]]]

 ; collapse, keeling over onto its side, and lie there
 [Animation Wound [[[From [Some Idle]] [To [Still Felled]] [Over 0.9] [Roll [Some [[To 20.0535]]]] [Marks [[End 1]]]]]]

 ; gathered to spring, growling
 [Animation Crouch
  [[[From [Some Idle]]
    [To [Still Coil]]
    [Over 0.3]
    [Layers [[[Lay [Waver [[On [OnRoot [1 0 0]]] [Sway [[Amplitude 0.008]]] [Rate 9]]]] [Onward True]]]]]]]

 ; springing, jaws first
 [Animation Tackle
  [[[From [Some [Still Coil]]] [To [Still Leap]] [Over 0.18] [Ease Out]] [[To [Still Bite]] [Over 0.3]]]]

 ; down on the ground a while, then up again - the getting up starting at its release
 [Animation Sprawl
  [[[From [Some [Still Leap]]] [To [Still Felled]] [Over 0.15] [Ease Linear]]
   [[To [Still Felled]] [Over 3.55]]
   [[To Idle] [Over 0.8] [Marks [[Release 0] [End 1]]]]]]]
